LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerM::
	.string "Many people are hard at work here\n"
	.string "in the RADIO TOWER.\p"
	.string "They must be doing their best to put\n"
	.string "on good shows.$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_1::
	.string "Oh, no, no, no!\p"
	.string "We’ve been off the air ever since\n"
	.string "the POWER PLANT shut down.\p"
	.string "All my efforts to start this station\n"
	.string "would be wasted if I can’t broadcast.\p"
	.string "I’ll be ruined!$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_2::
	.string "With that thing, you can tune into\n"
	.string "the radio programs here in KANTO.\p"
	.string "Gahahahaha!$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_3::
	.string "Ah! So you’re the {PLAYER} who solved\n"
	.string "the POWER PLANT’s problem?\p"
	.string "Thanks to you, I never lost my job.\p"
	.string "I tell you, you’re a real lifesaver!\p"
	.string "Please take this as my thanks.$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_4::
	.string "Huh? But, since you don’t have\n"
	.string "a RADIO-VISIO, it wouldn’t be of\l"
	.string "use to you.\p"
	.string "Get a RADIO-VISIO and I’ll give\n"
	.string "you an EXPN CARD for it!$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_Man_1::
	.string "Hey there, fellow!\p"
	.string "I am the super MUSIC DIRECTOR!\p"
	.string "Huh? Your RADIO-VISIO can’t tune\n"
	.string "into my music channels.\l"
	.string "How unfortunate!\p"
	.string "If you get an EXPN CARD upgrade,\n"
	.string "you can tune in. You’d better get\l"
	.string "one!$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_Man_2::
	.string "Hey there, fellow!\p"
	.string "I am the super MUSIC DIRECTOR!\p"
	.string "I’m responsible for the gorgeous\n"
	.string "melodies that go out over the air.\p"
	.string "Don’t be square.\l"
	.string "Grab your music off the air!$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist::
	.string "Welcome!\n"
	.string "Feel free to look around anywhere\l"
	.string "on this floor.$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_Policeman::
	.string "Sorry, but you can only tour the\n"
	.string "ground floor.\p"
	.string "Ever since JOHTO’s RADIO TOWER was\n"
	.string "taken over by a criminal gang, we\l"
	.string "have had to step up our security.$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_Sign1::
	.string "Perk Up POKéMON with Mellow Sounds\n"
	.string "of the POKéFLUTE on CHANNEL 20$"

LavRadioTower_Interior1_Text_Sign2::
	.string "1F RECEPTION\n"
	.string "2F SALES\l"
	.string "3F PERSONNEL\l"
	.string "4F PRODUCTION\l"
	.string "5F DIRECTOR’S OFFICE$"
